	</names>
	<elementInformations>
		<elementInformation name="designation" show="1">Pluggable terminal block 2x6</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="description" show="1">Pluggable (detachable) terminal block, two stacked rows of 6 positions, numbered 1 to 12; wires on top, plug underneath.</elementInformation>
	</elementInformations>
	<informations>Author: QElectroTech contributors
Generic pluggable terminal block, not copied from a manufacturer drawing. The wire side and the plug side of a pin share a potential. License: see http://qelectrotech.org/wiki/doc/elements_license</informations>
